Value slot (\S+)
Value power_supply (\d+)
Value model (\S+)
Value output_watts ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value input_watts ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value capacity_watts ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value power_supply_status (.+?)

Start
  ^${power_supply}\s+${model}\s+${output_watts}\s+W\s+${input_watts}\s+W\s+${capacity_watts}\s+W\s+${power_supply_status}\s*$$ -> Record
